## 6. Create Controller, Routes, and Views

### Generate Controller

```bash
php artisan make:controller JobApplicationController --resource
```

This creates `app/Http/Controllers/JobApplicationController.php` with all 7 resource methods (index, create, store, show, edit, update, destroy).

